<!--
    The mark: three bookmark ribbons fanned like tabs peeking out from behind
    each other — a shelf of saved things, not one article, which is closer to
    what Following actually does than a single bookmark would be. See
    ui/theme/Theme.kt for the palette these come from.

    Sized for the Android 12+ splash icon: 108dp canvas with the artwork
    inside the safe centre (the outer third is masked away). Kept well clear
    of the safe-zone edge — the fan's diagonal spread eats into the margin a
    single bookmark wouldn't, so it needs more headroom than 66dp gives.
-->
